flowchart TD
    BUG["**Bug Report**\nModel hallucinates X"]
    ATTR["**Attribution**\nWhich tokens caused it?\nIG, SHAP, attention"]
    LOC["**Localize**\nWhich layers/heads?\nActivation patching"]
    FIX["**Fix**\nEdit, steer, or retrain\nROME, RepE, fine-tune"]
    BUG --> ATTR --> LOC --> FIX
    style BUG fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    style ATTR fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,stroke-width:2px
    style LOC fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,stroke-width:2px
    style FIX fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
